      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TIME WILL TELL (6) is a fast dog well performed over the sprint races. Was a bit beyond her last time when fourth (30.37) over 515m at Launceston in a Grade 4/5 but is better suited here over less ground. Has a good record here at this journey including two wins. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Has winning claims on her best figures. TAH JOE (1) is boxed nicely on the inside. Last start finished 6th in a Grade 4 on August 25 over 340m at this track behind Wanaka beaten 5.5 lengths (19.92). Looks one of the chances. ODIN DANGER (2) turned in a plain effort last time when fifth at this track over 340m behind Bearville Flyer (19.86) in a Other. Has the ability to give this a shake. TEDDY DANGER (7) gets a chance to improve on an unplaced run at his latest outing at this circuit.",
